This copy is modified. Paseo's default-skills plugin ships only the skill's markdown:
SKILL.md, LICENSE and references/*.md. The scripts (scripts/snapshot.mjs, scripts/story.mjs),
the reference images (references/refs/*.webp), agents/openai.yaml and the rest of the
repository are left out. Changes to the text:

- SKILL.md, Run it step 1: the live-site snapshot step is marked unavailable; the agent asks the
  user for the saved page or a screenshot instead of fetching the URL.
- SKILL.md, Run it step 8: the story can be built but not rendered to a video in this install.
- SKILL.md, Story video intro: notes that story-dashboard-frames.webp is not included.
- SKILL.md, Story video step 8 (Render): the render step is marked unavailable; the agent does not
  install Playwright or ffmpeg and hands over the story file.
- references/visuals.md, Generate it: the agent tells the user an image tool could be connected
  and leaves connecting it to the user instead of offering to connect one itself.
- references/refs.md: notes that the images are not included and must not be downloaded.

The full list with reasons is in plugins/default-skills/vendor/SOURCES.md of the Paseo fork.
